# Malformed protocol frames, one per line (# and blank lines are comments).
#
# Shared corpus (spec §11, §11.1). The C# fuzz test in Crowsnest.Device.Tests and the
# firmware's Unity host test for crowsnest_link both read this file. Every line here must
# be REJECTED OR IGNORED by both ends without throwing, aborting or wedging the link —
# a frame only one end rejects is exactly the defect this arrangement exists to catch.
#
# Add a line whenever a real link produces something surprising. Never remove one.

